{
	"metadata.name": "§bKluonoa, the Skyward Patroller",
	"metadata.tips": "Kluonoa adamantly insists she only bought this battle frame \"for scrap metal to help pay the utility bills.\" Yet everyone soon noticed that this cutting-edge exoskeleton—decked out with solar-recharging cells, vector thrusters, and tactical folding wings—had been turned into the fastest takeout delivery rack and overclocked mobile workstation in the entire city. \"Skyrocketing through the clouds? Oh no no no, high G-forces are terrible for the joint bearings, coo!\" Kluonoa explains, gently adjusting her headset. \"Still, I have to admit, the frame's auxiliary processor lets me manage sixty customer support tickets simultaneously, all while beating *Castlevania* in the background three times over—plus, I never have to worry about troubling Wine Fox ever again, coo!\"",
